==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{der|ru|orv|зобота}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro}}, possibly from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*gab-|t=to watch, show}}.<ref>{{R:ine:IEW|349}}</ref>  Cognate with {{cog|gmw-pro|*kapēn||to watch, to look}}, {{cog|gem-pro|*kōpijaną||to look after, care for}} (whence {{cog|en|keep}}). Also compare {{cog|uk|забо́та}}, {{cog|sl|zóbati}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|забо́та}}
